Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.64,0:02:41.98,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}（Come）所有人
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.98,0:02:46.80,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}（True）集合起來！展開美好體驗！（要開始了！）
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.82,0:02:52.71,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}揮灑吧！響徹它！無畏地奔向明天
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.91,0:02:57.45,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}約定好的等待之地（就在眼前！）
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.48,0:03:03.34,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}實現吧！傳達它！當相信的那一刻起
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.34,0:03:07.54,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}乘上這道喜悅與奇蹟
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.99,0:03:11.22,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}令人鼓動加速的體驗（Experience）！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.29,0:03:14.50,OP_TW-G,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6\fad(200,200)}前往明天的舞台！
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,songtitle,,0,0,0,,----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.75,0:03:20.60,title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs77\pos(1790,923)}{\3c&H5100C3&\c&HFFFFFF&}去玩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:20.60,title1,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\an3\bord0.5\shad0\fscx67.1\t(0,300,\fscx395.2)\t(300,600,\fscx334.4)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H5100C3&\t(0,100,\bord2\blur3)\t(100,1200,\bord0.5\blur0)\p1\pos(1792.6,919.4)}m 0 0 l 100 0 l 100 -1 l 0 -1 m 0 18 l 100 18 l 100 19 l 0 19 m 0 36 l 100 36 l 100 37 l 0 37 m 0 54 l 100 54 l 100 55 l 0 55 m 0 72 l 100 72 l 100 73 l 0 73
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.75,0:03:20.60,title1,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\an3\shad0\fscx170\fscy170\t(300,6000,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H5100C3&\t(0,100,\bord2\blur3))\t(100,1200,\bord6\blur4)\p1\c&HF5F5F5&\frz13.46\3c&H5100C3&\pos(1420.6,903.4)}m 25 0 l 34 15 l 50 19 l 40 33 l 41 49 l 25 43 l 11 50 l 11 33 l 0 21 l 15 15 l 25 0
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,全副武裝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.69,0:03:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,果然給人這種感覺嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼關係 就穿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,妳很期待吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,同色系穿搭成功
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.03,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 很好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,話說妳們怎麼帶著吉他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想說在海邊彈會不會很舒暢就...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因為香澄說要帶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,要是想彈的時候沒有的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,對呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.65,0:03:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,妳知道我們要去哪裡嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是海邊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.87,0:04:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,假裝要去海邊 其實是去山上？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,要是去山上 這個全副武裝的不是很可憐嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.60,0:04:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,有咲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,走這邊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.22,0:04:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,紗綾 妳第一次來海邊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只有小學的時候跟班上一起去過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我有時候會跟家人一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,最近好像都沒有耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.35,0:04:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有次還溺水了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,妳不會游泳！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那妳是來幹嘛的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.48,0:04:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我會努力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,即使不會游泳 肯定也很好玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,吾可是超大魔凶亞子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.18,0:05:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,吾的鼓...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 闇黑的...呃...那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.80,0:05:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,亞子 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,闇黑的...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,燐燐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.86,0:05:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,亞子的鼓要讓所有人震驚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,要說什麼才會帥？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.99,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,喊一聲「碰～ 」不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想弄得帥氣一點
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.97,0:05:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,燐燐 幫幫我啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.22,0:05:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,呃..呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,宇田川同學 今井同學 白金同學
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要聊天的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜 這只是在練習{\fn華康中特圓體}MC{\fn}而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然這也是必要的 但請不要停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.22,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,練習量會直接反映在聲音裡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.15,0:05:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.30,0:06:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起來一次嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.64,0:06:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那同學呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我可能還要一些時間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn華康中特圓體}OK
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,紅茶要續杯嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.54,0:06:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,點心不夠的話 亞子去買
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.61,0:06:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,有什麼我們能做的都可以說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,曲子的基礎完成後
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.02,0:06:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也會開始構想吉他的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,期待妳的新曲子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.11,0:06:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.68,0:06:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,是海啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 吉他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.55,0:06:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會弄濕它的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妳肯定會摔倒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.54,0:06:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,給我 我幫妳拿...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:06:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有咲 我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就說了我幫妳拿吉他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,紗綾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,紗綾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.31,0:07:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,里美 多英
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,多英？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.31,0:07:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖在這等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.84,0:07:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.65,0:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,香澄 紗綾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,妳穿了泳衣來？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我也...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.95,0:07:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,香澄 不可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小朋友喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.40,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\c&H121111&\bord0\pos(802,168)}海之家Live
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.40,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\c&H121111&\bord0\fs44\frz341.9\pos(1280,506)}海之家主辦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.40,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\c&H121111&\bord0\fs44\pos(1344,742)}本店Woddeck
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.40,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\c&H121111&\bord0\fs45\pos(1042,864)}預定近日舉行！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.40,Tip,,0,0,0,,{\c&H121111&\bord0\fs45\pos(1044,988)}敬請期待！！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,上面說「海之家{\fn華康中特圓體}Live{\fn}」耶
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,會邊看{\fn華康中特圓體}Live{\fn}邊吃飯嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好像很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,要看看嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,它不是寫「近日舉行」嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這種感覺？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哪種啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,香澄 糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,下面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.27,0:08:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好像沒穿一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們腦中還有害羞這個概念嗎..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我去換衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,轉過去後面彈呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是天才嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要玩囉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,有咲 妳那身打扮...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想曬傷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好像賽車女郎喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs44\fn華康中特圓體}Race-queen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是海灘女郎呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs44\fn華康中特圓體}Beach-queen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,海灘女郎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs44\fn華康中特圓體\pos(908,990)}Beach-queen
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們全給我跪下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們玩很瘋耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.84,0:09:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,里美妳會游泳？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,會一點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,要潑囉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,請不要攻擊臉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,有破綻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我說妳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害 有好多星星
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 海星嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.50,0:09:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 大家腳下有超多的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是被咬了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.61,0:09:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.21,0:09:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,海星還會咬人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.22,0:10:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,晃到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,妳偷拍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起拍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.57,0:10:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,來拍來拍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.54,0:10:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,拍得進去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,可以可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,很擠耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那妳變小一點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼變啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.93,0:10:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要拍囉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,一、二
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不能幫什麼忙嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可是作曲啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.43,0:10:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那 我可以聽一下嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我個人是覺得很不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,個人感覺是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.59,0:10:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要做出{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Roselia{\fn}的...最棒的音樂才行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,去海邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,亞子妳們要不要也一起來？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.23,0:11:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我們可沒有玩樂的時間...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,這是轉換心情啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.63,0:11:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,去吃剉冰啊 薯條什麼的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,薯條？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.50,0:11:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我對那種垃圾食物沒有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不過要吃飯的話我也一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我就留在這...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,走嘛 燐燐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,去游泳嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,游泳？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也不用去海邊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不好會冒出不錯的想法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那妳再這樣下去 衣服搞不好會穿不下喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不會犯這種失誤...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.58,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 軟Ｑ軟Ｑ的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣看來腰圍應該也...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.74,0:11:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,太蠻橫了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.56,0:11:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,完成了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,紗綾 感覺怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.03,0:12:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.48,0:12:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,完全動彈不得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,實現夢想了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 謝謝妳們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,「想試試被埋進沙灘裡」是什麼鬼？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.33,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,接著換我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,快把我埋起來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我也肚子餓了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,總..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.91,0:12:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,總算..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,紗綾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.30,0:12:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,還有戶山同學跟牛込同學
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,亞子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,燐子學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fn華康中特圓體}Poppi'Pa{\fn}？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧 好巧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,太巧了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,很巧...是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.25,0:12:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.89,0:12:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,原來{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Roselia{\fn}還會去玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我們不是來玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.14,0:12:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是合宿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.24,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我們借了附近的小木屋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,今井同學 要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,在這裡吃嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:12:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真沒辦法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們兩個要點什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,姐姐我請客
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃剉冰嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.27,0:13:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,偶爾也不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大家一起來這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,才不好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,得快點人出完美的樂句
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs44\fn華康中特圓體\pos(1202,990)}Phrase
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,莉莎...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不補充水分會中暑的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好甜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那學姐 莉莎學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.98,0:13:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是..
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我是戶山香澄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.63,0:13:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝妳請我們吃炒麵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 連我的份也請了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.30,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,下次換妳們請客哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:13:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:13:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,騙妳的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然後如果可以的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要一起打沙灘排球？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那學姐來囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.02,0:14:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那姐好美
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因為沙灘排球好像是要穿泳衣打的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.15,0:14:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很好看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.82,0:14:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,湊同學 妳要打嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.09,0:14:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,妳不知道嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.86,0:14:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,沙灘排球是沙灘上的運動
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,非常適合拿來鍛鍊體力喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,體力...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,彈奏樂器很需要體力的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,還是說紗夜妳要自己待著？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜 妳不熱嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不熱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Roselia{\fn}對{\fn華康中特圓體}Poppin'Party
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.33,0:14:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,請..請開始
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我要發球囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,紗~綾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,話說...規則呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.46,0:15:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,跟排球...一樣嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.58,0:15:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,球落地...就輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不能掉到沙灘上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我也不是很懂
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.54,0:15:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這次換我們了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,呃...總之問一下妳們那是在幹嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,為無敵的必殺技命名
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,命名…？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,解放寄宿在吾龍之右臂的闇黑之力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,接招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,大魔神 究極之球
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.04,0:15:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,亞子 沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,這是何等殘酷的運動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 看來大意不得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 那邊那兩位...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.64,0:16:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要代替亞子加入戰局
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.59,0:16:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,到底什麼跟什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.63,0:16:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我去換衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.55,0:16:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 這樣就完美了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 我們要反擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.96,0:16:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜同學...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.98,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.92,0:16:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要發球囉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,燐子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,紗夜同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,湊同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 友希那
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.53,0:16:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,友希那姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我要上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,結果是我們贏了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我到途中還有在算分啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,被妳們的步調帶著走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺...就像合奏了一場
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.17,0:17:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs44\fn華康中特圓體\pos(1038,988)}Seeeion
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我們玩得很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,改天大家再一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.08,0:17:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Roselia{\fn}耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.04,0:17:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,為了完美的演奏 沒有時間玩樂...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那就大家一起組樂團
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,十個人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.27,0:17:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然也有這種樂團...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,居然有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.47,0:17:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妳不知道還這樣說的嗎...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Roselia'Party…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,簡稱{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Rose'Pa{\fn}？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Rose'Pa{\fn}好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,亞子覺得{\fnDFGCraftYu-W5}Roselia{\fn}武道會比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.44,0:18:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝您幫忙保管東西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.94,0:18:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不用謝 不用謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.63,0:18:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐們要不要當作試音 彈奏一曲啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,妳們是樂團吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.93,0:18:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是{\fn華康中特圓體}Poppin'Party
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.10,0:18:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,還真突然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然鼓還沒送到 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼辦啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,用手機播放之前的錄音嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我也唱歌好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.41,0:18:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,紗綾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 準備好了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,請欣賞 《八月的ｉｆ》
Comment: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:53.44,songtitle,,0,0,0,,ＩＮ 「八月のif」 作詞：中村航，作曲、編曲：藤永龍太郎，歌 -Poppin'Party(戶山香澄、花園多惠、牛込里美、山吹沙綾、市谷有咲)
