Comment: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:51.34,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k56}「そ{\k49}れ{\k51}ぞ{\k50}れ{\k76}夢、{\k31}追{\k20}い{\k47}か{\k15}け{\k19}た{\k16}？」
Comment: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:55.08,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k27}「でも{\k37}ホ{\k36}ン{\k25}ト{\k63}に{\k28}そ{\k15}う{\k29}な{\k39}の{\k27}か{\k34}な{\k12}？」
Comment: 0,0:19:55.08,0:20:03.30,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k92}「やっ{\k39}ぱ{\k23}り{\k50}ね、{\k90}いつ{\k34}か{\k71}は…{\k55}出{\k72}会っ{\k27}て{\k125}た{\k27}の{\k25}か{\k73}な{\k19}？」
Comment: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:11.27,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k98}煌{\k132}め{\k46}い{\k98}た{\k25}{\k105}八{\k76}月{\k49}の{\k50}'i{\k90}f'
Comment: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:19.22,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k112}短{\k22}い{\k74}夏{\k56}の{\k20}ひ{\k20}み{\k57}つ{\k124}　探{\k45}し{\k51}に{\k27}い{\k51}こ{\k49}う{\k86}よ
Comment: 0,0:20:19.29,0:20:27.23,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k84}息{\k47}を{\k122}と{\k57}め{\k103}て{\k67}　そ{\k53}の{\k50}ま{\k27}ま{\k47}で{\k50}い{\k87}て
Comment: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:35.75,Lyric_Ushinawareta,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k51}'もしも'{\k24}じゃ{\k37}な{\k37}い{\k58}'今'{\k92}を{\k26}抱{\k23}き{\k32}し{\k24}め{\k54}て{\k37}い{\k349}る
