Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.06,0:22:17.28,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}Close to me…star mine
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.57,0:22:21.09,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}衝上天際吧
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.06,0:22:33.62,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}描繪一片蒼藍色 Fly high！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.62,0:22:36.20,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}點綴純白飛機雲 Fly high！
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.20,0:22:41.25,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}溫柔地去描繪便會浮現
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.34,0:22:43.83,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}全部的回憶
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.84,0:22:46.47,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}真面目感受到的是
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.47,0:22:51.71,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}我們依然牽繫在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.10,0:22:58.35,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}Let's start it now！ah…
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.27,0:23:04.24,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}Find a way out！
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.64,0:23:08.64,ED_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}強烈到眼前昏眩
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.64,0:23:10.05,ED_TW-A,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\bord6}We carry on…
